@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : Ask to add an industry.
    activate System

        System-->Employee:Ask for the XY position.

    deactivate System

    Employee->System:Gives XY.

    activate System
    System-->Employee:Show the different types of industry and ask one option.

    deactivate System

   Employee->System:Select one option.

   activate System

   System-->Employee:Show the different types of industries of that type and ask one option.

   deactivate System

   Employee-->System:Select one option.

   activate System

   System-->Employee:Confirm the creation of this industry.

   deactivate System




@enduml
